WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.500
[gasps] Halt.

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:12.500
[wailing sound playing]

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:18.333
[sniffing]

00:00:20.417 --> 00:00:21.417
[wailing stops]

00:00:24.292 --> 00:00:25.792
- [sniffs]
- [chuckles]

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:31.166
<i>♪ Love is a song
That never ends ♪</i>

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.249
[Buzzes chuckle]

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.207
<i>♪ Life may be swift
And fleeting ♪</i>

00:00:35.208 --> 00:00:37.708
[all chuckling]

00:00:38.417 --> 00:00:43.499
<i>♪ Hope may die
Yet love's beautiful music ♪</i>

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.332
<i>♪ Comes each day
Like the dawn-- ♪</i>

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:49.417
[♪ ominous music playing]

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:52.792
Hon, I'm pretty sure we go this way.

00:00:53.708 --> 00:00:54.832
[spouse] You sure?

00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:57.166
[grunting]

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:58.707
[footsteps approaching]

00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.792
Save yourselves.

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:06.874
It's this line here.

00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:08.999
If we follow it...

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.749
- There's our camp.
- Oh, I see.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.083
Yeah, that looks right.

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.333
Hey, wait for me, guys!

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.624
- Whoa. No way.
- [all gasp]

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.791
Hey, Morgan! Look at this.

00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:23.541
[Morgan] Lucky. Hey, let me see it.

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:24.624
Nope. Finders keepers.

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:25.541
- Mom!
- Man down.

00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:26.624
- Code red.
- Code red.

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:28.791
- Code red. Code red. Code red.
- Kids, be nice.

00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:31.667
Code red. Code red. Code red.

00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:36.874
Blaze, I'm going out. Be back in an hour.

00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:38.208
[Blaze] Okay, Mom.

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:44.166
[grunts, panting]

00:01:44.167 --> 00:01:46.166
Get Bullseye, get out.
Get Bullseye, get out.

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:47.958
- Hey, cowgirl?
- Shh.

00:01:48.542 --> 00:01:50.792
- [gasps]
- Ooh. Forgot my keys.

00:01:54.417 --> 00:01:57.416
- Ugh! [coughing]
- [Smarty Pants groaning]

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:58.707
Really don't feel so good.

00:01:58.708 --> 00:02:00.916
I think I'm gonna... [burps] ...reboot.

00:02:00.917 --> 00:02:01.999
[♪ upbeat music playing]

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.541
Shh. Quiet, quiet, quiet.
Quiet, quiet, quiet, quiet.

00:02:04.542 --> 00:02:06.375
- [grunts] Quiet.
- [♪ music stops]

00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:09.167
[gasps]

00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:13.832
[Smarty Pants] Wait. Wait.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.791
Wait, I'm back.

00:02:15.792 --> 00:02:17.583
I'm back home.

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:22.041
- This is where it all started.
- [groans]

00:02:22.042 --> 00:02:23.124
Yeah.

00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:25.374
- It's all changed.
- [groans]

00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:27.499
[gasps] Smarty, no.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.874
I-I have to find Bullseye. Wake up!

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:32.749
- Need more juice.
- [beeping]

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.791
Okay! W-Where are the batteries?

00:02:34.792 --> 00:02:36.374
Where do I find the batteries?

00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:40.917
Bottom drawer, next to the stamps.

00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:43.792
[strains]

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:50.957
<i>Why, hello there! Pick a number.</i>

00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:51.957
<i>Is it number one?</i>

00:02:51.958 --> 00:02:54.374
- Whoa! I feel great!
- Shh!

00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:55.707
- Look at me!
- Shh! No!

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.791
- Yes! [laughs]
- No, we're not doing this now.

00:02:57.792 --> 00:02:58.874
- Not now.
- I am back!

00:02:58.875 --> 00:03:01.041
- Cut it out!
- [gasps]

00:03:01.042 --> 00:03:03.874
Snappy. Atlas. They're still here!

00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:05.916
Oh! Bossy cowgirl,
we have to turn 'em back on.

00:03:05.917 --> 00:03:07.291
No! No way.

00:03:07.292 --> 00:03:09.374
The last thing this world
needs is more devices.

00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:10.582
What, what, what?

00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:13.041
You're just gonna shove 'em
back in the dark forever?

00:03:13.042 --> 00:03:15.124
Do you have any idea what that's like?

00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:16.207
[♪ pensive music playing]

00:03:16.208 --> 00:03:17.332
[sighs]

00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:20.291
Fine. We gotta make this quick.

00:03:20.292 --> 00:03:21.832
[laughs] Yes!

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.083
<i>Number one! You made number--</i>

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:29.957
- Atlas! Snappy!
- Smarty!

00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:31.749
- Smarty? Is that you?
- Is it really you?

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.124
- It's really me! Yes!
- My goodness. You look great.

00:03:34.125 --> 00:03:35.832
- The AA-Team is back!
- Oh, my gosh. Yes!

00:03:35.833 --> 00:03:37.874
Mom brought us inside
after that tantrum Blaze had,

00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:38.999
and we never saw you again.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.041
- So tell me. What did I miss?
- Oh, my gosh.

00:03:41.042 --> 00:03:43.207
Well, we've been down a long time too.

00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:46.041
But look! I could show you how
first and second grade went!

00:03:46.042 --> 00:03:47.332
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Please do that. Yeah.

00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:49.624
Look at her! She's so much older.

00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:51.249
- I know, right?
- She's adorable.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.916
- Isn't she?
- She got bangs that year.

00:03:52.917 --> 00:03:55.332
- Wait a minute. Where is that?
- That's Disneyland.

00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:56.457
Zoom in. That's me in her pocket.

00:03:56.458 --> 00:03:57.916
Oh, flush. You both went there?

00:03:57.917 --> 00:03:59.542
- [Snappy] Mm-hmm. For reals.
- [Atlas] It's so beautiful.

00:04:00.458 --> 00:04:02.291
And, uh, that's the last of it.

00:04:02.292 --> 00:04:04.541
Next, it was just
a spinning rainbow wheel.

00:04:04.542 --> 00:04:06.082
Then... darkness.

00:04:06.083 --> 00:04:07.999
My entire SD card flashed before my eyes.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.166
- [Smarty Pants] Wow.
- [Atlas] Aw.

00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:12.749
Okay, okay. I am glad you're
all powered up and stuff,

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.749
but we're wasting time I don't got.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:17.124
Oh, we're so grateful to you, cowboy lady.

00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:19.041
Guys, guys, guys,
this is pushy cowgirl Jessie.

00:04:19.042 --> 00:04:21.207
She claims she's a sheriff.
Just go with it.

00:04:21.208 --> 00:04:23.332
- Blaze has her horse, Banzai--
- Bullseye!

00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:25.791
And I gotta get us back
to our kid, Bonnie, now.

00:04:25.792 --> 00:04:28.082
She needs us. So, where is he, Smarty?

00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:30.832
All right, okay. I said
I'd tell ya, so I'll tell ya.

00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:32.832
- Drumroll please.
- [thudding]

00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:35.791
He's probably in the bedroom.

00:04:35.792 --> 00:04:38.541
Probably in the bedroom?
I could've guessed that.

00:04:38.542 --> 00:04:40.874
- And yet, you did not, Dusty.
- Dusty?

00:04:40.875 --> 00:04:43.166
Yeah, you know, like ancient,
elderly, mummified old fart.

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:45.541
Or as I like to call it, number 1.5.

00:04:45.542 --> 00:04:46.749
- I missed you, Smarty.
- [chuckles]

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:47.832
You know what?

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:49.208
- I've had enough of your cr--
- Oh, wait!

00:04:49.833 --> 00:04:52.207
I just had an idea that could
maybe help you get to Bonnie.

00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:54.541
- [sighs] What?
- It's a little technical,

00:04:54.542 --> 00:04:55.624
but if the three of us link up--

00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:58.957
No, no, I am done
with this techno mumbo jumbo.

00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:02.291
No offense, but I'll be fine
getting back on my own.

00:05:02.292 --> 00:05:03.625
Offense taken!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.582
You're muted, Dave. You're muted.

00:05:10.583 --> 00:05:11.874
Okay. There you go.

00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:13.624
[Dave] <i>Only have a bit
of time left. One more time--</i>

00:05:13.625 --> 00:05:15.291
[Blaze's dad] You're muted again, Dave.

00:05:15.292 --> 00:05:17.416
[Smarty Pants grunting]

00:05:17.417 --> 00:05:18.999
Oh, cheese and crackers!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.332
What are you doing? Get back.

00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:22.916
You're not the only one
who misses their kid, okay?

00:05:22.917 --> 00:05:24.291
- Now help us up.
- [sighs]

00:05:24.292 --> 00:05:25.374
[all grunting]

00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:27.166
Careful, careful! You're gonna unplug me.

00:05:27.167 --> 00:05:29.582
- [door opens]
- Blaze, I'm home.

00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:30.582
[Blaze] Hey, Mom!

00:05:30.583 --> 00:05:31.958
Back, back, back!

00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:34.666
- [toys grunting]
- Hey, Mom?

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:37.082
- Wait a second. Is that...
- Is that big girl Blaze?

00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:39.541
- She's changed so much!
- Like overnight.

00:05:39.542 --> 00:05:41.332
- Is she here yet?
- [Blaze's mom] Not yet.

00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:42.416
Why don't you try messaging her?

00:05:42.417 --> 00:05:43.999
- [Snappy] Whoa.
- She big, big.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.832
- She...
- [toilet flushes]

00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:48.042
She did it without me.

